`c63804255ac4730c871a44a1fccb6a863138ce00`, with clean staged/committed tree
`03c824c377765ac01cb1f53a47494f4ff602b12e`.

Changed subsystem: x86_64 composed-selector integer comparisons and intrinsic
call lowering. Part 1 adds exact named i16 `slt` / `sgt` / `ne` normalization
through existing compare/setcc forms. Part 2 adds exact
`llvm.ucmp.i32.i128` and `llvm.scmp.i32.i128` over existing SysV i128 argument
pairs, plus a state-owned unique EAX join label using the existing verifier
join convention.

Tier-3 trigger: the `validation_tiers.md` row-closure batching amendment and
INBOX-46 require one cumulative Tier 3 at the end of this two-step pipeline to
accept its four Tier-2/native-proven provisional closures.

Exact command and evidence log:

```text
